v2.6.39-rc1[1] compared to v2.6.38[2].

Summarized:
  - build errors: +66/-34
  - build warnings: +424/-111

In addition, I put the verbose summary at
http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/geert/linux-log/v2.6.39-rc1.summary.gz
so you can easily find out for which configs and architectures the
errors/warnings you're interested in are happening.

Happy fixing! ;-)

Thanks to the linux-next team for providing the build service.

